00-0000 Sample Message (Johannesburg)
1 One of the most thrilling moments of my life has come. I have waited fifteen years for this opportunity. Ever since I left you, I have wanted with all my heart to see you again. I have prayed very much to come here again.
2 But I firmly believe that with the help of God I will again minister in the Name of the Lord Jesus among the Africans. God has promised to give us the desire of our heart, and this is one of the desires of my heart.
3 In a few minutes I hope to meet you here, to shake your hand and to fellowship together again. I am thankful for all these wonderful people.
